  pvcMountDescs?: string(name='PvcMountDescs', description='Configures Kubernetes PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC) mounts. This lets you mount a Kubernetes PVC volume to a specified container directory. The parameters for \\\\`PvcMountDescs\\\\` are as follows:

- \\\\`pvcName\\\\`: The name of the PVC volume. The PVC volume must already exist and be in the Bound state.

