To clear this configuration, set the value to "" or {}. If you do not set this parameter, it is ignored.', example='{"failureThreshold": 3,"initialDelaySeconds": 5,"successThreshold": 1,"timeoutSeconds": 1,"tcpSocket":{"host":"", "port":8080}}'),
