- true: Disables overwriting.

- false: Allows overwriting.', example='true'),
  port?: string(name='Port', description='The frontend port. The value ranges from 1 to 65535.', example='80'),
  scheduler?: string(name='Scheduler', description='The scheduling algorithm of the SLB instance. If you do not set this parameter, rr is used. The supported algorithms are round-robin (rr) and weighted round-robin (wrr).

