- Round-robin (rr): Requests are distributed to backend servers in sequence.', example='wrr'),
  servicePortInfos?: string(name='ServicePortInfos', description='This parameter is used for scenarios that involve multiple ports or protocols other than TCP. The value must be a JSON array. For example:
